Multiplication:
    as in addition two numbers combines but give a product instead of sum

    An abbriviated form of repeated addition 
        add 2, 5 times
            2 + 2 + 2 + 2 + 2 = 10

            or

        2 * 5 = 10   # short an easy to write and solve 
            reads two times 5 # time = *

            2 and 5 are factors
            10 is product
    represented by:
        a coss(x)
        a dot(.)  # different than decimal point as the multiplication dot is not at bottom it is at middle vertically
